cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
title: "STEPS: Serially Transferred Evolving Population Simulator"
abstract: >-
  Simulates the dynamics of asexual populations as they grow and evolve through
  a serial transfer experiment, with beneficial, neutral, and deleterious
  mutations arising during growth and periodic bottlenecks imposing genetic
  drift.
type: software
version: 2.0.1
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
